{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":57,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"80d630bf-92a3-479f-89cd-1d670675f886","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310705900,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"销售经理（工业视觉）","OrgId":554239,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责根据公司发展战略，制定客户的销售计划，达成预期销售目标；\n2.负责客户项目需求分析、完成项目投标相关工作；　\n3.负责项目推进、谈判、签约及回款工作，协助团队做好风险控制；\n4.负责做好销售合同的签订、履行与管理等相关工作，以及协调处理各类市场问题；\n5.负责收集、分析行业及客户需求，进行工业机器人视觉应用业务的市场宣传推广工作。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，3年以上销售工作经验，工业自动化行业优先；\n2.为人诚实敬业、清正廉洁、工作严谨细致、责任心强、善于沟通；\n3.能适应经常出差，有较强的抗压能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2023-03-24T16:28:59","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"6a7d14c3-7349-49d7-9c36-5cf4493a2e99","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310704413,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外售前方案（韩语）","OrgId":640575,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"职责描述：\n1、对公司韩国大客户、集成商进行售前技术沟通与支持，包括需求分析、项目评估等；\n2、针对客户需求，制作项目初步方案，并可用流利韩语向客户讲解与沟通；\n3、充分掌握公司3D视觉产品，灵活应用于项目方案；\n4、具体方案设计、BOM、技术协议、成本估价等；\n5、负责视觉解决方案标准化，规范化英文文档的撰写，对外培训文档等；\n6、客户定期技术交流与培训；\n\n\n\n公司介绍:\n梅卡曼德机器人致力于推动智能机器人无所不在的存在。公司在3D感知、视觉和机器人算法、机器人软件、行业应用方案方面均有深厚积累，已经形成包括3D相机、机器视觉算法和软件、机器人智能编程环境在内的智能机器人基础设施产品栈。梅卡曼德的智能工业机器人解决方案已经在汽车、家电、钢铁、食品、物流仓、医院、银行等多个领域实际落地，应用范围涵盖拆码垛、货品拣选、上料、装配、涂胶、定位等，收获了众多行业标杆客户的认可，业务覆盖中国、日本、欧洲、新加坡、美国、韩国、泰国等国家.\n公司已完成C轮融资，投资人包括美团、IDG资本、红杉中国、源码资本、英特尔资本、启明创投等投资机构，刷新了全球AI+工业机器人领域融资记录。 \n\n梅卡曼德总部位于北京（产品）和上海（销售和交付），在深圳、长沙、青岛、慕尼黑、东京、芝加哥等多个城市设有子公司、分公司和支持团队。公司已经入选高新技术企业、中关村金种子企业、北京市企业科技研究开发机构、中关村国际前沿科技创新大赛AI领域等多项政府扶持项目。 公司发展迅速，当前团队规模超过700人。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、本科以上学历，理工科（机械、图像处理、自动化等）相关专业；\n2、 具备一定视觉相关技术基础；\n3、良好的韩语文档撰写能力，善于从使用者角度考虑问题；\n4、 善于沟通，耐心，充分理解客户需求；优异的韩语表达能力；\n5、具备自动化项目关键部件和技术的合理选型能力，并熟悉供应链，能够相对准确的选型估价；\n6、能够接受出差，有驾照。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2023-03-21T15:28:28","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false